WEBVTT

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.540
Majo Rika...

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.970
Just you watch, I'll make you suffer with my own two hands.

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:17.120
Oh, this is getting me all excited!

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:55.300
We're really in the red this month...

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.090
She's coming again. It's in your hands now!

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:08.580
~ Well then, today, I've come to receive... ~

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:12.150
~ the payment for the bag of... ~

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:14.230
~ magic spheres! ~

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:19.950
You've come all this way, so maybe you'd like some tea? Right? Right? Right?

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:23.240
So, how's that tea?

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:27.030
It's getting late, how's my payment?

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:30.590
Oh, right! I've got some delicious cake!

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:32.790
Oh, my.

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:35.470
It is delicious.

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:38.300
By the way, do you have any interesting goods?

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:41.960
Interesting goods? Well, let me think...

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:45.730
Well, it's not really goods, but here.

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:47.480
We'll play for the magic spheres.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.940
Cards?

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.690
Wanna bet?

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:53.510
So I can bet you anything?

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:58.270
If I win, how about I don't have to pay for the magic spheres?

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:01.860
Fine, but if I win you pay double.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:02.820
Fine by me.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:03.740
Hey...!

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:11.420
One pair.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.050
Two pair.

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.170
Three of a kind.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.750
Straight!

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:18.630
Full house.

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.510
Four of a kind!

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.640
Straight flush!

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.050
Royal straight flush!

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:27.090
I lost...

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:33.030
I'm on such a roll today it's scary!

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:35.820
All of my debt is gone!

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:38.040
This is so frustrating...

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.820
One more game! One more!

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.410
Bring it on!

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:52.720
The Rival Debuts! The Maho-dou is in Big Trouble!!

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:57.840
No way...

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:01.430
10 straight wins followed by 10 straight losses...

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:02.300
Alright!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.730
No! One more game!

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:06.890
Please, just stop it.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.650
Right, right... It's about time I went back.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.430
Leaving after you win is pretty low!

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:15.860
My... In that case, if I win...

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:18.320
I get your shop.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.200
Wait, Dela...

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:21.490
And if I win?

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.820
A ten year supply of magic spheres.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.470
You got it!

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:26.030
Wait!

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:28.740
Wow!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:32.730
This the deed to the shop, and the Queen's business license.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.250
Now, let us battle!

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.920
Okay...

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:39.240
Good morning, Hadzuki-chan, Ai-chan!

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.190
Good morning!

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.670
Mornin'!

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:46.180
Good morning!

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.140
Access denied!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:52.270
This is no longer your shop.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.370
What?

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:54.710
What're ya talkin' about?

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:55.960
I'm talking about this.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:59.650
I now have this shop's deed and business license.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.210
I won them playing cards!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.810
What the heck?

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:06.780
Are those real?

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:08.290
Of course!

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:09.740
So, that means...

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:12.580
I now own this shop.

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:17.260
And there you have it.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.730
What's going on!?

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:22.260
And my heart lies still, forever more...

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:24.010
We didn't ask ya 'bout that!

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:27.970
What should we do with the Maho-dou taken over by someone?

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.420
We can't get any more magic spheres...

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:33.140
So we can't be witch apprentices anymore?

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.350
Yeah, seems like it.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.480
How could you bet something crazy like that?

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:39.750
Yeah really!

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:43.330
And we finally passed the level 7 exam.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.450
Anyway, let's bet Dela once more.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:48.810
I guess so...

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:50.660
It's no use! No use!

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:55.330
You're...!

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:56.800
Majo Ruka!

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:00.290
Majo Rika, what's with that stupid body?

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.180
Why are you here?

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:05.200
I'll tell you.

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:09.180
It's because I'm the new owner of the Maho-dou.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:10.550
The new...

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:11.870
...owner of the...

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.030
...Maho-dou?

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.350
What did you say!?

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.270
Which means...

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:19.150
...that we're finished with you.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.190
Shoo, shoo.

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:24.650
Shoo, shoo...

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:29.710
Too bad for you, Majo Rika!

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:32.790
Now I'll be the next Queen for sure!

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:41.860
Hey, who exactly is this Majo Ruka?

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.670
And what'd she mean by "the next Queen?"

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:49.260
Majo Ruka was in the same class as Majo Rika back in magic school.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:50.280
Eh?

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:54.990
Back then, those two were rivals.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.550
Rivals making magic items...

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.250
Or rivals at broom riding...

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:05.190
Of course, her magic power is quite considerable.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:14.240
And everyone pays attention to whoever owns that shop.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.700
That shop? You mean the Maho-dou?

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:24.530
Right. Lineage tradition dictates that whomever is the owner of the Maho-dou will be next in line to be Queen.

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:25.670
Queen?

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:29.380
The current Queen was the previous owner of that shop.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:37.870
And in order to fairly decide who would get the shop next, they held a lottery,

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.430
and Majo Rika was the winner!

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:43.300
Ya'll do a lottery for somethin' important like that?

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.360
That's some crazy luck...

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.210
Unlike someone I know...

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:48.280
What was that?

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:54.800
I thought that owning that shop would be my ticket to becoming the next Queen, but now this...

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:57.990
For now, we have no choice but to return to the Witch World.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:59.450
Oh, no!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.250
Can't you stay here?

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.250
We have no place to live.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:04.420
Yes we do!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:08.380
Doremi, starting today, your house is now our house!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.090
W-Why?

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:14.010
This is payback for you turning me into this in the first place!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:17.760
After giving you all those magic spheres, after you became a witch apprentice,

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:20.180
my shop sank deeper and deeper into debt!

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:23.190
And I'm your magic teacher!

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:26.360
When I'm in trouble you should do everything you can to help me!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.060
Okay, let's go.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.170
Is this for real?

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:33.270
She's pretty intense...

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:35.030
Doremi-chan, fight!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.490
This shop is totally drab.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:43.960
Majo Rika's style is just as old-fashioned as always.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:52.290
Not bad, not bad.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:00.360
Wow, he looks pretty cute.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:06.400
Right, now that we're all here, let's open shop!

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:09.160
This is MY time now...

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:10.400
Seems like it.

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:14.950
But, before that, we've got to remodel this place.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:21.920
I never thought I'd be living in a place like this.

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.420
Don't just come in!

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:25.500
What'll you do if you're seen?

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.370
We'll deal with that when it happens.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.270
Give me a break...

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:35.580
All clear.

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:36.770
What a pain.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.390
Whose sake do you think this is for?

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:45.850
Doremi!

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.310
W-What?

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.150
Mom says to clean up your room.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.430
G-Got it!

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:52.460
That's all.

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.430
What was that just now?

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.620
Phew, that was close.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:06.120
This okay? This can be your guys' room for now.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.880
Thank you.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.580
Don't go thanking her.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:13.040
If you've got a problem with it, then just get out.

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:17.100
Without a magic teacher, you'll never become a decent witch.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:19.370
Doremi, I'm coming in!

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.760
Why are you being so loud in here?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:27.230
Sorry, I just smashed my hand in the drawer when I pulled it out.

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:29.350
Please be careful.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:30.190
Hey...

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.610
Didn't I tell you to clean up?

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:35.070
I'm in the middle of cleaning right now!

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:37.040
Are you doing it seriously?

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:39.560
Anyway, when you're done, come on downstairs.

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:42.490
I've got some manjuu we can eat together.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.090
Okay!

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:49.000
Hey!! You trying to crush me!?

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:51.500
It was just an accident...

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:55.340
Ouch... the back of my head hurts.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:56.770
Massage it, Dodo.

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.930
I'm thirsty, Doremi.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:02.770
Yeah, yeah...

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:03.930
Also...

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:07.850
I want one of those manjuu your mom mentioned earlier.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:09.720
Yeah, yeah.

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:34.890
So what's it like with Majo Rika livin' with ya...

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:36.520
It's one thing after another...

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:39.340
She wanted a croissant and coffee for breakfast!

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:42.030
We don't have stuff like that at my house!

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:46.510
Hey, Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan, will either of you take Majo Rika in?

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:47.080
Eh!?

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:49.760
Well, that's a little...

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:51.260
Doremi-chan, fight!

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:54.430
You're tellin' me...

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:58.660
We gotta fight this somehow.

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:00.100
But what should we do?

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:02.490
Good morning!

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:03.910
G-Good morning.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:04.890
Morning.

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:06.090
Mornin'.

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:07.370
Good morning, ladies.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:10.870
What's that shiny gold thing?

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:13.500
Oh, this? It's a magic item.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:16.420
I bought it yesterday at the "Original" Maho-dou.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:17.630
"Original?"

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:21.820
I guess you girls got fired, eh?

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:24.980
No, we didn't get fired!

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:25.840
Yeah!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:29.120
That new shop is just my style!

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:31.020
And they have such wonderful employees!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.810
It's so different from when you girls worked there.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.350
Ooh, she's makin' me mad now...

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.220
But that makes me wonder...

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:39.840
Alright! We're going to check this out on our way home!

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:40.730
Yeah.

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:47.890
Original Maho-dou?

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.490
What's up with that?

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:51.450
They seem to be doing pretty well.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.800
What do they mean, Original Maho-dou?

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:54.920
Doremi-chan!

00:12:57.930 --> 00:12:58.900
What're we doin'?

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:01.630
We'll disguise ourselves as customers and sneak in.

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:02.840
Okay.

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:05.210
Let's go!

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:05.880
Okay!

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:22.160
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:25.750
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.450
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:34.040
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:39.540
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:45.340
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:47.710
Turn us into boys!

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:57.300
It's really stylish.

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:58.860
Well dang...

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:02.010
How could they do this to our shop!?

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.100
Greetings!

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:04.910
Welcome!

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:08.240
Thanks...

00:14:09.270 --> 00:14:10.950
They really are pretty.

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:13.950
They're so pretty, it's kinda suspicious.

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.420
These just aren't my style.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.590
Welcome to the Original Maho-dou!

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:24.090
What kind of goods might you be searching for?

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:31.170
Um, well, maybe you've got something to become the world's happiest pretty girl, or something?

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:32.960
Yer a boy now, y'know...

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:34.520
Oh, I have that!

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:39.980
Look at this. If you carry it, you'll become very, very happy.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.150
Eh!? For real!?

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:42.650
Y-Yeah...

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:46.860
If I carry this, I'll really be the world's happiest pretty girl!?

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:48.320
I-I guess so...

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:51.160
I'll take it.

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.530
Hey, hey...

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.700
Thank you very much.

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:57.050
Thanks, thanks.

00:14:57.050 --> 00:14:58.210
Hey, hey...

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:00.590
We didn't go there to shop!

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:01.500
Yeah, well...

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:05.380
When I thought I'd be the happiest in the world, I just...

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.550
But they really had a lot of customers, didn't they?

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:10.800
People're just curious 'cause they renovated.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.010
Yeah.

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:16.220
It can't be...

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:18.730
Pigeon droppings?

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.610
No way...

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:26.150
Doremi-chan!?

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:29.830
Are you okay?

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:31.810
It's just been one thing after another today...

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:38.610
That magic item you bought is to make you be the unluckiest person in the world.

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:42.250
It looks like our magic goods are super effective.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:44.070
Yer that fairy from earlier!

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:46.040
Then we were...

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:49.520
Your silly Ojamajo-magic was way too easy to see through!

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:52.050
They got us...

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:57.840
I feel like we just took a step backward.

00:15:57.840 --> 00:15:59.620
Ah, that bath was nice.

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.370
Yes, there's nothing like a good bath, is there?

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:04.440
Didn't I tell you not to leave my room!?

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:07.400
This isn't the time to take a leisurely bath!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:10.610
Because of you, the shop has been taken over!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:14.570
Our shop being like this, and everyone, everyone...

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:17.000
This is all your fault!

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:21.040
And besides... it was my dream to become a witch.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.170
Doremi...

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.940
It was bad luck!

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:26.080
Majo Rika...

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:30.240
I've escaped into the bottle!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:34.420
Ahhhh! That's my dad's precious sake!

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:38.180
Jeez...

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:47.050
Doremi, Doremi!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.240
Majo Rika's gone.

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:52.740
Maybe she went for a walk?

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.950
I know where she went.

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:07.060
Majo Rika...

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:09.140
I think she's devastated by this...

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:13.340
That shop is very important to Majo Rika.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.220
And she really wanted to return to her original form.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:20.350
To appear in that body in front of her rival, Majo Ruka...

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.340
It must have been very difficult for her.

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.190
Let's go home.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:29.160
She probably wouldn't want us to see her like this.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:30.440
Doremi...

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:32.390
We're the same, you know?

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:37.950
We want to take the Maho-dou back, and hurry up and return Majo Rika to her original self.

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:40.880
But what should we do?

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:45.860
So it's like that, huh?

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:48.470
She's just putting up a strong front for us.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:51.790
Look at that.

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:53.760
Magic goods from the Original Maho-dou?

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.010
What's goin' on?

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.470
Looks like they're everywhere...

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:00.290
Hey, it's the Laid-off Trio!

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:04.670
Since you left, that shop's taken off!

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:06.060
You were in the red...

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.130
But now you're red in the face!

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:08.520
Oh, can it!
But now you're red in the face!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.890
And what's more, it's totally popular!

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:12.230
With all that dough...

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:13.820
they could bake a cake!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.530
Whaddya guys think yer...

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:18.310
You country bumpkins!

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:20.030
Don't mind them.

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:23.490
It won't be long till everyone gets over those things.

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:25.950
Masaru-kun...

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:27.930
What's with those guys?

00:18:27.930 --> 00:18:30.100
Well, there's only one thing to do now.

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:30.920
What's that?

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:34.480
We must make a new Maho-dou all by ourselves!

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.260
Will you help me?

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:41.540
What do you think?

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:43.890
We'll clean it up, and turn it into a shop!

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:47.840
We cleaned up the Maho-dou before too, remember?

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:49.500
Nice idea!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:50.580
I agree.

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:53.190
Then it's settled. Let's do it!

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.690
Yeah!

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:02.320
Wouldn't this be easier with magic?

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:06.590
No, we can't.  We've got to save our remaining magic spheres.

00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:07.540
That's right.

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:22.170
I hazn't seen dat Doremi 'round lately, whas she doin'?

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:31.130
I'm heading out!

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:36.630
Good morning!

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:38.580
Yer late!

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:39.530
Good morning.

00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:12.620
Doremi?

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:14.070
Doremi!

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:18.100
What have you been doing lately, leaving me alone?

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:19.660
Good timing.

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:21.900
We've got something we want to show you.

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.380
What is it?

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:38.170
This is our Maho-dou!

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.500
Now, come on in!

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:41.960
Whaddaya think?

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:43.590
Pretty nice, huh?

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:47.550
If we try our best with this shop, we'll sell lots of magic goods.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:50.550
And then we'll take back the Maho-dou!

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:52.770
Take back our Maho-dou!

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:53.760
Right?

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:55.940
You girls...

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:01.660
And now the finishin' touch.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:02.560
Hurry up.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:03.530
Go for it.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:08.160
Man, what a troublesome thing you girls thought up.

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.580
We did it!

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:12.220
Yeah!

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:21.070
Wow, it's so cute!

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:21.740
Ain't it?

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:22.920
We really worked hard on it.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.690
Now, let's open up!

00:21:24.690 --> 00:21:26.100
Wait, wait!

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:28.830
We made it from a bus, so...

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:36.340
Now let's go out there and sell our butts off!

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:37.480
Yeah!

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:45.590
Welcome!

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:49.490
How 'bout some cute magic goods?

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:52.410
Come to our magic goods store, the Maho-dou!

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:56.150
We're telling everyone about the Maho-dou!

00:21:56.150 --> 00:21:59.230
The Maho-dou is everyone's shop!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:04.490
The town falls under a dark shadow...

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:06.510
Majo Ruka's magic goods!

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:08.340
Their effects really are amazing, but...

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:10.680
...everyone starts to fall into despair!

00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:12.720
We can't just wait around like this!

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:15.230
But level 7 witch apprentices like us...

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:17.560
...can't win against Majo Ruka's magic!

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:20.200
Majo Rika, lend us your power!

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:22.770
Please, save everyone!

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:24.110
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:26.180
Majo Ruka's Goods are Super Dangerous.

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:29.020
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
